+# Finite: the gateway judges a goal off the event loop while /goal controls
+# stay live on it. The judge's writes are held per thread and committed once,
+# under the lock every goal write takes, only if the stored goal is unchanged.
+_GOAL_WRITE_LOCK = threading.Lock()
+_DEFERRED_GOAL_WRITES = threading.local()
